{"3600590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Squad", "steam_appid": 3600590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>CBT - Playtest</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/635bb4e0e38d8176d64060671a2ca541.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the first one to get The Last Squad latest news and test the new version of the game in our official Discord!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world’s largest bio-mechanics corporation, <strong>Virix</strong>, dreamed of creating “better humans” through a global human-modification initiative known as the <strong>Utopia Project</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the final experiment produced not hope, but disaster: the unknown substance called the <strong>Virix Particle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those exposed to what scientists once called a “new beginning” were transformed into bloodthirsty monsters, and civilization collapsed overnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/752df1672fd0788cb8eed9ca0d614370.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities became both graveyards and hunting grounds. Yet a rare few resisted the infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a mysterious <strong>reverse immune mutation — the Hyrix Response</strong>, some humans awakened transcendent abilities, but even such powers weren’t enough to turn the tide alone, and so, they formed a team. Their name: <strong>The Last Squad.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Squad is sent to the most critical areas to cleanse the Virix  threat for the sake of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“What will remain of humanity?”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/8ff159b7ec88d14ab619f26fa7f48efb.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1170 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your skills against hordes of infected creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The keys to victory reside in your accurate fully manual aiming, ammo management, reload timing, and resource capture. No interruptions during battle — decisions only happen between rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/2a7ddc93bd363fbb116dcd7a2bdf929b.poster.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/2a7ddc93bd363fbb116dcd7a2bdf929b.webm?t=1785293636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/2a7ddc93bd363fbb116dcd7a2bdf929b.mp4?t=1785293636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become stronger with dual growth system</strong> Combine run-based skill/item synergies with permanent traits/XP progression to enhance your battle skills to be ready for the stronger foes to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/fcc9dfd0a2780923034e7c9222924f50.poster.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/fcc9dfd0a2780923034e7c9222924f50.webm?t=1785293636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/fcc9dfd0a2780923034e7c9222924f50.mp4?t=1785293636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces in a 4-Player Co-op Synergy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite other players to defeat the rotten menace. Choose <strong>Tank, DPS, and Healer</strong> roles to face enemies as a powerful squad  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/1bc3c4b2c35ddb398b6260dda22426fd.poster.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/1bc3c4b2c35ddb398b6260dda22426fd.webm?t=1785293636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/1bc3c4b2c35ddb398b6260dda22426fd.mp4?t=1785293636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eradicate the virus threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No monster is allowed to be left. The game ends once you and your team has removed all abominations from the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/52fb6538b418b47c98212422ce11b93c.poster.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/52fb6538b418b47c98212422ce11b93c.webm?t=1785293636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/52fb6538b418b47c98212422ce11b93c.mp4?t=1785293636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world’s largest bio-mechanics corporation, <strong>Virix</strong>, dreamed of creating “better humans” through a global human-modification initiative known as the <strong>Utopia Project</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the final experiment produced not hope, but disaster: the unknown substance called the <strong>Virix Particle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those exposed to what scientists once called a “new beginning” were transformed into bloodthirsty monsters, and civilization collapsed overnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/752df1672fd0788cb8eed9ca0d614370.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities became both graveyards and hunting grounds. Yet a rare few resisted the infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a mysterious <strong>reverse immune mutation — the Hyrix Response</strong>, some humans awakened transcendent abilities, but even such powers weren’t enough to turn the tide alone, and so, they formed a team. Their name: <strong>The Last Squad.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Squad is sent to the most critical areas to cleanse the Virix  threat for the sake of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“What will remain of humanity?”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/8ff159b7ec88d14ab619f26fa7f48efb.avif?t=1785293636\" width=1170 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul